    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Сто шестьдесят на девяносто.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'One hundred sixty over ninety.' Lyova reads out the blood pressure numbers with concern.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Виктор Петрович, это не шутки.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Viktor Petrovich, this is not a joke.' Addressing his boss respectfully, he emphasizes that this medical reading is no laughing matter.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Такое давление — это очень опасно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Such pressure is very dangerous.' Pointing out the severity, he explains how dangerous such high pressure can be.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Да, всё будет хорошо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, everything will be fine.' Barinov waves off the concern, insisting that everything is perfectly fine.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Любой стресс и будет плохо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Any stress and it will be bad.' Warning him of the consequences, Lyova states that any additional strain could lead to a bad outcome.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Привет, мама.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hi, Mom.' Greeting his mother, Lyova shifts the conversation entirely.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "Как прошёл твой рабочий день?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How was your workday?' Mama asks about his day at the restaurant.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Нормально, меня уволили.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Fine, they fired me.' Lyova casually drops the bombshell that he lost his job.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "Не уволили, а понизили.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not fired, but demoted.' Mama corrects him, clarifying that he was only demoted, not fired.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Мама, я ни в чём не виноват.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mom, I am not guilty of anything.' Defending himself, Lyova insists he did absolutely nothing wrong.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "Надо уметь отвечать за свои поступки.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You must know how to answer for your actions.' Mama offers a stern lesson, telling him he needs to take responsibility for his choices.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
